<title>USA: CIBC names debt cap mkts managing director.</title>
<headline>CIBC names debt cap mkts managing director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy said it named Leressa Crockett managing director in its debt capital markets division.</p>
<p>Crockett, who had worked at Salomon Inc, will develop CIBC's investment grade debt capital markets activities, CIBC said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
